  "body": "## New features:\r\n* feat: add colour on empty search by @Its-Just-Nans in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/375\r\n\r\n## Bug fixes:\r\n* Remove svg from binary extension detection by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/355\r\n* Avoid searching again when toggling escape sequences by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/357\r\n\r\n## Other changes:\r\n* Bump various deps\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Its-Just-Nans made their first contribution in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/375\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/compare/v0.9.0...v0.9.1",
